---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Local override of al_folio_core's cv layout: renders the page content (the
  English/한국어 tabs in _pages/cv.md, built with _includes/cv_body.liquid) instead of
  the single-language al_folio_cv_render tag. Keeping the name `cv` makes head.liquid
  load al-folio-cv.css.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="post">
  <header class="post-header">
    <h1 class="post-title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
    {% if page.description %}<p class="post-description">{{ page.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </header>

  <article>
    {{ content }}
  </article>
</div>
